WEBVTT

00:03:29.388 --> 00:03:31.084
this is what happens.

00:03:31.084 --> 00:03:33.413
Only 530 are left.

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:34.810
If you look at it from that perspective,

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.130
fewer than ten new men per [year]

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.613
have joined the sub-four mile club

00:03:38.613 --> 00:03:40.915
since Sir Roger Bannister.

00:03:40.915 --> 00:03:43.982
Now, 530 is a lot more than one,

00:03:43.982 --> 00:03:45.498
and that's partly because
there are many more people

00:03:45.498 --> 00:03:48.012
training today and they're training more intelligently.

00:03:48.012 --> 00:03:50.240
Even college kids are professional in their training

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:51.766
compared to Sir Roger Bannister,

00:03:51.766 --> 00:03:53.225
who trained for 45 minutes at a time

00:03:53.225 --> 00:03:56.315
while he ditched gynecology lectures in med school.

00:03:56.315 --> 00:03:58.718
And that guy who won the 1904 Olympic marathon

00:03:58.718 --> 00:04:00.429
in three in a half hours,